    "leaf_noca|inter_noca|root|1748736000|example.com||x509: certificate signed by unknown authority (possibly because of \"x509: invalid signature: parent certificate cannot sign this kind of certificate\" while trying to verify candidate authority certificate \"inter_noca\")",
    "leaf_deep|inter_sub,inter_len0|root|1748736000|example.com||x509: too many intermediates for path length constraint",
    "leaf_shallow|inter_len0|root|1748736000|example.com||ok leaf_shallow>inter_len0>root",
    "leaf_nc_ok|inter_nc|root|1748736000|www.example.com||ok leaf_nc_ok>inter_nc>root",
    "leaf_nc_org|inter_nc|root|1748736000|www.example.com||x509: a root or intermediate certificate is not authorized to sign for this name: DNS name \"example.org\" is not permitted by any constraint",
    "leaf_nc_bad|inter_nc|root|1748736000|x.bad.example.com||x509: a root or intermediate certificate is not authorized to sign for this name: DNS name \"x.bad.example.com\" is excluded by constraint \"bad.example.com\"",
